{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずバタバタしております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことに\nなかなかブログをまとめる時間がなくて。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の要領の悪さのせいです。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ブログもお仕事も\n中途半端ではなく\nちゃんとやりたいので\n内容のないブログでも\n毎日更新すると約束したので\nします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントは読んでますよ！！！\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！北野日奈子です٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものあいさつ遅れた('∀`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/14/1443392/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/14/1443392/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/14/1443392/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から2日間\nいよいよ深川さんの卒業コンサートになります。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業発表をされてから\n半年が経つなんて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに早くお別れの日が来るとは\n思いませんでした。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいし、\n深川さんといたずらし合うのとか\n話をするのが楽しくて大好きだから\nまだまだ一緒にいたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、この思いをライブに\nぶつけようと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、終わって\n感じたことをまたブログに書きます(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう感じるんだろう。\n大好きな先輩とのお別れ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんとたくさんの愛で\n見送れるように楽しみます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/14/1443392/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/14/1443392/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がおー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/14/1443392/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2日間！\n深川さんと写真撮って貰おうっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではおやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}